{
  "id": "slippage-limit-entry-01",
  "title": {
    "en": "Limit Entry vs Chasing at Market",
    "bn": "Limit entry বনাম market-এ তাড়া করা"
  },
  "symbol": "EURUSD",
  "timeframe": "H1",
  "mode": "synthetic",
  "type": "trade-setup",
  "bias": "bullish",
  "outcome": "win",
  "tags": [
    "slippage",
    "limit-order",
    "entry"
  ],
  "module": "10-trade-management-execution",
  "lessonSlugs": [
    "04-slippage-requote-spread-widening"
  ],
  "caption": {
    "en": "Price jumps to 1.0935. A market order near 1.0932 would risk 57 pips for the same target. A limit at the 1.0905 retest risks 30 pips.",
    "bn": "দাম 1.0935-এ লাফ দেয়। 1.0932-এর কাছে market order একই target-এ 57 pip ঝুঁকি নিত। 1.0905 retest-এ limit-এ ঝুঁকি 30 pip।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "A pending order avoids a bad fill in a fast move, but it may not fill at all.",
    "bn": "Pending order দ্রুত চালে খারাপ fill এড়ায়, কিন্তু fill না-ও হতে পারে।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "In a fast market, set the price instead of chasing it",
      "bn": "দ্রুত বাজারে দাম তাড়া না করে দাম ঠিক করে রাখুন"
    }
  ],
